00:18:09,626 --> 00:18:35,626
Someday, when I polish these pieces, I want to see you shining like a diamond, splashing around.

294
00:18:36,122 --> 00:18:41,122
It's like, "I was just imagining something like that right now.

295
00:18:41,122 --> 00:18:46,122
I've been imagining that right now.

