Do you pay attention to your eyes?

306
00:19:35,994 --> 00:19:53,994
I don't know. I don't take notes or anything, and I don't think about anything.

307
00:19:53,994 --> 00:19:54,994
Usually.

308
00:19:54,994 --> 00:20:04,994
Yes, I do. If I think about it, it would be difficult, or if I start thinking like that.

309
00:20:05,680 --> 00:20:10,400
Yes, that's pretty much the case now.

310
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:15,200
There are times when I have a sudden flash of inspiration, but...

311
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:21,040
It's like the Olympics.

312
